#!/usr/bin/env bash
# cellar-help — show the keybinding reference in fuzzel.
# Called by Ctrl+Alt+F1 or the waybar Help button.
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'KEYS'
  The desk modifier is Ctrl + Alt, and every action is exactly
  Ctrl + Alt + <one key>. Zellij uses the same letters with Alt
  instead — Ctrl+Alt+H changes window focus, Alt+H focuses a pane.

  Windows (labwc stacks; it does not tile)
  Ctrl + Alt + H / L              Previous / next window
  Ctrl + Alt + ← ↓ ↑ →            Move the window
  Ctrl + Alt + Shift + ← ↓ ↑ →    Resize the window
  Ctrl + Alt + X                  Close window
  Ctrl + Alt + F                  Fullscreen
  Ctrl + Alt + W                  Maximize / restore
  Ctrl + Alt + Q                  Exit the desktop (confirms)

  Workspaces
  Ctrl + Alt + 1 - 5              Switch workspace (click the top bar too)
  Ctrl + Alt + M                  Send window to a workspace (menu)

  Monitors
  Ctrl + Alt + ]                  Next monitor
  Ctrl + Alt + [                  Previous monitor
  ⇱ (top bar)                     Pick a monitor
  Win + Shift + ← / →             Windows-native (same thing)

  Launching
  Ctrl + Alt + Space              Start menu
  Ctrl + Alt + T                  Terminal
  Ctrl + Alt + D                  Apps
  Ctrl + Alt + B                  Firefox
  Ctrl + Alt + O                  Files
  Ctrl + Alt + S                  Software center
  Ctrl + Alt + C                  Control Center
  Ctrl + Alt + V                  Clipboard history
  Ctrl + Alt + P                  Screenshot a region
  Ctrl + Alt + F1                 This help

  Mouse (the desktop is mouse-first)
  Ctrl + Alt + left-drag          Move a window
  Ctrl + Alt + right-drag         Resize a window
  drag a window border            Resize
  right-click the desktop         Root menu

  Packages (the visual software center, Ctrl+Alt+S)
  Rows badge what is already there: system (in the flake),
  frozen (user-packages.list), local (your nix profile)
  Search → Install = local, this user, no rebuild (cellar use)
  Freeze in → Deploy = permanent, git-backed (cellar freeze)
  cellar profile / frozen         list the two installable lanes
  cellar use|unuse <pkg>          quick local install / remove
  cellar freeze|unfreeze <pkg>    promote / drop from the declarative list

  Zellij (inside the desktop session) — same letters, Alt prefix
  Alt + H / J / K / L             Focus
  Alt + arrows                    Focus
  Alt + M                         Move pane
  Alt + N                         New pane
  Alt + F                         Fullscreen pane
  Alt + W                         Floating panes
  Alt + X                         Close pane
  Alt + R                         Resize mode
  Alt + 1 - 9                     Jump to tab

  Windows side
  Alt + F4                        Close the window

  Title bar buttons (top-right): ─ minimize, □ maximize/restore, × close,
    ⇱ move to another monitor (picker)
    × fully closes the desktop — relaunch with `cellar ui`
KEYS